  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "NTRQ was Neil Baldwin's attempt at making a 'proper' computer-style tracker on the NES.\r\n\r\nFeatures include: variable pattern length, software/hardware pitch sweep, smooth pitch slide and vibrato, complex arpeggios, duty modulation, Auto Echo, speed table (groove), software ADSR, delay, detune.\r\n"
    }
